---
import Layout from "../../Base.astro";
import SimpleHero from "../../components/SimpleHero.astro";
import Services from "../../components/Services.astro";
import { buildCollectionPageSchema, buildItemList } from "../../lib/schema";

const schema = buildCollectionPageSchema(
  "Kelp's Services",
  "Digital services from branding and design to development, marketing, media, and ongoing support.",
  buildItemList([
    { name: "AI Integrations", url: "/services/ai-integrations/" },
    { name: "AI Chatbots & Agents", url: "/services/ai-chatbots-agents/" },
    { name: "AI Automation", url: "/services/ai-automation/" },
    { name: "AI Ecommerce", url: "/services/ai-ecommerce/" },
    {
      name: "AI Search Optimization",
      url: "/services/ai-search-optimization/",
    },
    { name: "Apparel Design", url: "/services/apparel-design/" },
    { name: "Branding", url: "/services/branding/" },
    { name: "Digital Design", url: "/services/digital-design/" },
    { name: "Print Design", url: "/services/print-design/" },
    { name: "Applications", url: "/services/applications/" },
    { name: "Website Development", url: "/services/website-development/" },
    { name: "Ecommerce", url: "/services/ecommerce/" },
    { name: "Audience Targeting", url: "/services/audience-targeting/" },
    { name: "Campaign Management", url: "/services/campaign-management/" },
    { name: "Copywriting", url: "/services/copywriting/" },
    { name: "Digital Marketing", url: "/services/digital-marketing/" },
    { name: "Social PPC", url: "/services/social-ppc/" },
    { name: "Social Media Content", url: "/services/social-media-content/" },
    { name: "Reporting", url: "/services/reporting/" },
    { name: "Motion Graphics", url: "/services/motion-graphics/" },
    { name: "Photography", url: "/services/photography/" },
    { name: "Video", url: "/services/video/" },
    { name: "Ongoing Retainers", url: "/services/ongoing-retainers/" },
    { name: "Web Hosting", url: "/services/web-hosting/" },
    { name: "Website Support", url: "/services/website-support/" },
  ]),
);
import "../../styles/pages/_services-list.scss";
---

<Layout
  title="Website, Ecommerce &amp; Marketing Services | Kelp Agency"
  description="Explore Kelp&#x27;s website development, ecommerce, branding, digital marketing, and ongoing support services. Built around your business, not a template."
  darkHeader={true}
  schema={schema}
>
  <article>
    <SimpleHero
      title="What <br><span style='margin-left: 1em;'>We Do</span>"
      description="Businesses usually come to us when something is not connecting: the brand feels unclear, the website is underperforming, the marketing lacks direction, or the team needs ongoing support. We help identify the problem, fix the system around it, and give you a clear way forward."
      dark={true}
    />
    <Services />
    <section class="service-body">
      <div class="wrapper wrapper--narrow">
        <p>
          We work with organizations that need more than a new look. You may
          need a storefront connected to inventory, a website that explains a
          complex service, a campaign that turns qualified traffic into
          enquiries, or a partner who can keep the system improving after
          launch. We start by understanding the customer journey and the tools
          behind it, then recommend the work that will make the biggest
          difference.
        </p>
        <h2>Where Teams Get Stuck</h2>
        <p>
          A business may have a recognizable brand, a working website, and
          active campaigns while customers still experience them as separate
          pieces. The page that earns attention does not explain the offer, the
          store cannot reflect real inventory, and the sales team cannot tell
          which channel produced a useful enquiry.
        </p>
        <h2>How We Fix It</h2>
        <p>
          We begin with the decision the customer is trying to make and the
          systems that support it. Strategy, content, design, development,
          media, and measurement are then scoped together where they affect the
          same outcome. Some clients need one focused service; others need the
          disciplines to work as one team.
        </p>
        <h2>Websites and Applications</h2>
        <p>
          Website design and development for businesses that need clearer
          messaging, easier navigation, stronger conversion paths, and reliable
          technology. When a standard site cannot support the workflow, custom
          applications can connect data, people, and processes.
        </p>
        <h2>Ecommerce and Integrations</h2>
        <p>
          Ecommerce development that considers the full path from product
          discovery to fulfillment. We work across Shopify and WooCommerce and
          can scope connections to POS, inventory, ERP, shipping, pricing, and
          production systems. In <a href="/work/us-labels/">US Labels</a>, Kelp rebuilt a custom label designer
          and connected WooCommerce to Windows printing software through a
          purpose-built API service.
        </p>
        <h2>Brand, Marketing, and Content</h2>
        <p>
          Branding makes the offer recognizable and consistent. Digital
          marketing brings that message to the right audience and measures what
          happens next. Photography, video, copy, and design give people
          evidence they can use to make a decision.
        </p>
        <h2>Ongoing Improvement</h2>
        <p>
          Launch is a milestone, not the end of the work. Website support and
          ongoing retainers help teams maintain, measure, and improve the
          experience as their business changes.
        </p>
        <p>
          The internet is changing again. Search and AI systems increasingly
          shape how people discover and compare businesses. The useful response
          is to make your site clear, accessible, accurate, and genuinely
          helpful. Start with Kelp's free{" "}
          <a href="/website-checker/">Website Checker</a> for a quick report on
          broken links, AI search readiness, technical and local SEO, conversion
          opportunities, and schema. Then talk with Kelp about the work behind
          the findings.
        </p>
        <h2>What the Work Includes</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Discovery of customer and staff workflows</li>
          <li>A prioritized website, commerce, brand, or marketing plan</li>
          <li>
            Specialists who can carry the work from concept through launch
          </li>
          <li>Ongoing support as the business and channels change</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>What Moving Forward Looks Like</h2>
        <p>
          Tell us what feels disconnected today and what a better customer or
          staff experience would look like. We can recommend the smallest useful
          starting project and the capabilities it needs.
        </p>
        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <h3>Do we need to hire Kelp for every service?</h3>
        <p>
          No. We can solve a focused problem, support your internal team, or
          take on connected work when several disciplines need to move together.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="/contact/" class="button button--green">
            Talk Through Your Project
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
